Third-Party Components and References
-------------------------------------

Compile-time dependencies (obtained via openvela repo sync, not vendored here):

  * openvela / Apache NuttX — Apache License 2.0
    https://github.com/open-vela/openvela

  * LVGL — MIT License
    https://github.com/lvgl/lvgl

  * SiFli BSP and HAL (vendor/sifli) — supplied with openvela board support

Implementation references (interfaces / documented patterns, not copied source):

  * LVGL on NuttX initialization follows the sequence documented in
    openvela apps/examples/lvgldemo/lvgldemo.c (Apache License 2.0).

  * HLK-LD2451 UART frame format — Hi-Link public serial protocol V1.03;
    parser implemented in app/edge_walker/ew_ld2451.c.

  * ESP AT Wi-Fi module — Espressif AT command interface over UART; official
    AT firmware may be flashed separately; driver in ew_wifi_at.c is original.

  * openvela ai_agent — Skill/Tool registration macros; approach_alert Tool
    in app/edge_walker/ai_agent_ext/ is team-authored.

Runtime assets (not included in this repository):

  * Optional Source Han Sans or Noto Sans CJK fonts may be deployed to
    /data/font/ under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The application does not
    require an external font to start or render its built-in Chinese UI.

  * Xiaomi MiMo API — contest-provided cloud LLM; credentials via runtime
    /data/ai_agent/config/config.json only.

Embedded font asset:

  * app/edge_walker/ew_font_cjk_18.c — LVGL bitmap subset generated from
    Adobe Source Han Sans CN Bold. Source Han Sans is licensed under the SIL
    Open Font License 1.1. The original font file is not redistributed here.
    Full license: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/SourceHanSans-OFL-1.1.txt
    https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-han-sans
    https://openfontlicense.org/open-font-license-official-text/

Hardware documentation:

  * SiFli SF32LB52-DevKit-LCD design files and wiki — property of SiFli;
    download from official links listed in docs/sifli_pinout_sources/README.md.
    This repository does not redistribute SiFli PDF/Gerber/wiki mirrors.

Contest templates retained in this repository:

